  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients and adjust pH to 7.2. Distribute 0.92 volume of the medium into tubes (e.g., 4.6 ml of the medium in the Hungate tubes) under a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "To complete the medium, add the following stock solutions [Filter--sterilize NaHCO3 solution and store under a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture. The other solutions are autoclaved and stored anaerobically under a N2 atmosphere] to the medium (per 4.6 ml):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}